title The seating that belonged to the ladder
prompt Autonomous loop -- the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, council rota row 0
think Standfast first: the ledger stood exactly where the prior lap left it, every living row closed, so the line was clear and the named crux moved.
think Council rota row 0, Jupiter and aether -- why the work exists. The compass rose, the Lindy effect, the grain and the crossing. The Lindy reading shaped this lap directly: a body published once in the harness is read by every future rung, while thirty-seven copies are thirty-seven places a later reader must check to learn one contract.
think Measured the family before touching it. Hashing every seat_the_record body across the 110 modules found 37 identical at 30 lines, a three-rung family at 24, and a two-rung family at 30 -- so the fold is exactly thirty-seven, and the five neighbors stay because they seat different records.
think Checked the contract. Ten symbols the body reaches for; eight already public in all thirty-seven, and the two private ones -- unhand and precede -- are imports rather than rung vocabulary. So the harness imports them itself rather than widening thirty-seven files, and no rung changed a declaration to make this fold possible.
obs This fold widened nothing at all, which is the cleanest shape the arc has taken. The prior lap widened one const across seventeen rungs; this one widened zero, because the two symbols it needed belong to the ladder rather than to any rung. Reaching a shared module through the harness's own import is the honest reading of what precede and unhand are.
obs The fall is again exactly the family's own carry less its call. Carry 85,670 to 84,698, a fall of 972, which is 36 copies at 30 lines returned less 36 copies at 3 lines paid. Delegates rise 2,461 to 2,498, exactly thirty-seven. Two folds in one sitting, the same arithmetic both times, which is what a meter is for.
obs The aether row named the reason the fold is worth taking at all. seat_the_record is the ladder's own contract -- read each phase plainly, refuse a plan whose order stalls or whose seats stand unfilled, close the record, carry each reserve and bearing exactly once. A contract written thirty-seven times is a contract nobody can change; written once, it can be read, checked, and taught. That is Lindy at the scale of a function.
obs No cairn is owed. A lift is the shallowest of the three depths of removal, and nothing left the tree that was not byte-identical to something that stayed.
