recommend keep-going the queue's head is read_the_finding at 20 rungs by 55 lines, then may_pass at 51 by 19, then choose_pass at 43 by 22 -- read_the_finding is the crux, the deepest of the three, and the harness pattern now stands proven at seventeen, thirty-seven, forty-three, and seventy-nine rungs. Beside it the machine half of the address space stays owed and named: page-table entry bytes, an ASID from seL4_ASIDPoolBits, the retype itself. The libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word, still blocking rungs 3 and 4 of the Microkernel Target arc.
